<view class="container">
  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">拍包装</view>
    <view class="muted small">
      配料表、营养成分表、生产许可证编号常常不在同一面。
      一张拍不全就多拍一张，最多 {{maxImages}} 张，会当作同一件商品一起识别。
    </view>

    <!-- 已拍的照片 -->
    <view wx:if="{{shots.length}}" style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:20rpx;">
      <view wx:for="{{shots}}" wx:key="*this" style="position:relative;margin:0 16rpx 16rpx 0;">
        <image src="{{item}}" data-idx="{{index}}" bindtap="preview"
               style="width:160rpx;height:160rpx;border-radius:12rpx;background:#eef1ef;" mode="aspectFill"/>
        <view data-idx="{{index}}" bindtap="removeShot"
              style="position:absolute;top:-10rpx;right:-10rpx;width:44rpx;height:44rpx;line-height:40rpx;text-align:center;background:#c53030;color:#fff;border-radius:50%;font-size:28rpx;">×</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <button class="btn-primary" bindtap="takePhoto" disabled="{{scanning || shots.length >= maxImages}}">
      {{shots.length ? '再拍一张' : '拍照'}}
    </button>
    <button class="btn-secondary" bindtap="fromAlbum" disabled="{{scanning || shots.length >= maxImages}}">从相册选</button>
    <view class="muted small" wx:if="{{shots.length >= maxImages}}" style="margin-top:12rpx;">
      已经 {{maxImages}} 张了，再多识别会变慢
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card" wx:if="{{shots.length && !scanning}}">
    <button class="btn-primary" bindtap="start">看这 {{shots.length}} 张，出结论</button>
  </view>

  <view class="card" wx:if="{{scanning}}">
    <view>{{progress}}</view>
    <view class="muted small" style="margin-top:8rpx;">
      已用 {{elapsed}} 秒<text wx:if="{{hint}}"> · {{hint}}</text>
    </view>
    <view style="height:8rpx;background:#eef1ef;border-radius:4rpx;margin-top:16rpx;overflow:hidden;">
      <view style="height:100%;background:#2f7a4d;width:{{elapsed >= 20 ? 95 : elapsed * 4.75}}%;transition:width 1s linear;"></view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card bg-warn" wx:if="{{error}}">
    <view class="level-warn">{{error.message}}</view>
    <view class="muted small" wx:if="{{error.detail}}">{{error.detail}}</view>
    <button class="btn-secondary" wx:if="{{error.canManual}}" bindtap="manualEntry">手动填写关键数值</button>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="row" bindtap="gotoFamily">
      <text>家庭成员</text><text class="muted">配置谁要注意什么 ›</text>
    </view>
    <view class="row" bindtap="gotoHistory">
      <text>历史记录</text><text class="muted">看之前扫过的 ›</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="muted small" style="padding: 16rpx 8rpx;">
    结论依据包装标注与公开标准自动生成，仅供家庭参考，不构成医疗或营养建议。
  </view>
</view>
